  m_text: "The story follows a struggling student who continually fails his Philippine
    History subject. Hoping to improve, he spends long hours in the library, where
    silence stirs memories of his childhood in the province under the care of his
    Lola. As these memories deepen, a transition unfolds\u2014granting him the chance
    to return to his hometown. There, his Lola warmly welcomes him, and his journey
    begins: a path of rediscovering his roots, reconnecting with culture, and embracing
    the stories of the land that shaped him."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c3a4a435baa510b46892cf1359281af7, type: 2}
