  m_text: "Blending nostalgia, cultural immersion, and modern gamification, LANDAS
    offers a dynamic learning experience that reconnects young Filipinos with their
    identity and values. It aims to not only help students appreciate their heritage,
    but also inspire pride in being Filipino\u2014making the past not just a lesson,
    but a meaningful adventure for the future."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
