  m_text: "This marks the beginning of a heartfelt and educational journey. Under
    Lola\u2019s guidance, the protagonist relives the vibrant traditions of the Filipino
    countryside: playing Larong Pinoy, learning cultural practices, exploring local
    recipes, understanding historical narratives, and deepening his knowledge of
